<title>DENMARK: Denmark's Superfos bids for local Phoenix.</title>
<headline>Denmark's Superfos bids for local Phoenix.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish construction and chemicals group Superfos A/S said on Thursday that it had offered shareholders in local road-builder Phoenix Contractors a total of 767 million crowns for their holdings.</p>
<p>A Superfos statement said that Superfos offered 700 Danish crowns per share for Phoenix A-shares, and 620 crowns for its C-share, surpassing an offer from Norway's Rieber and Son of 650 Danish crowns for the A-share and 585 for the C-share.</p>
</text>
